  18 pull requests submitted:
  - Rationale for spare cids (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/185=20
  - Some proposed editorial improvements from Ben Kaduk (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/184=20
  - Remove stale text about out-of-epoch records (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/183=20
  - Not totally indefinitely (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/182=20
  - Some textual clarifications around when ACKs are sent (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/181=20
  - Alerts are unreliable (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/180=20
  - Rcid excessive (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/179=20
  - Clarify when you can reset the timer (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/178=20
  - Records with bogus epochs should be discarded, not generate alerts (by =
ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/177=20
  - Fix some issues around the Finished message (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/173=20
  - The advise to aggressively age out was too aggressive (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/172=20
  - Don't require always buffering and require that retransmission be ide=
=E2=80=A6 (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/171=20
  - Stop citing RFC2522 (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/169=20
  - PMTU estimates (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/168=20
  - Require that cipher suites define a record number encryption algorithm =
(by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/166=20
  - Fixed portions of the record layer (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/165=20
  - Clean up use of connection and association (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/164=20
  - Reference tls-old-versions-deprecate (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/163=20

  2 pull requests received 2 new comments:
  - #179 Rcid excessive (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/179=20
  - #161 Ciphersuites seems to miss a "_8" (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/161=20

  9 pull requests merged:
  - Remove stale text about out-of-epoch records
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/183=20
  - Not totally indefinitely
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/182=20
  - Some textual clarifications around when ACKs are sent
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/181=20
  - Clarify when you can reset the timer
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/178=20
  - Fix some issues around the Finished message
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/173=20
  - Fixed portions of the record layer
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/165=20
  - Clean up use of connection and association
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/164=20
  - Reference tls-old-versions-deprecate
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/163=20
  - editorial/nits from AD review
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/160=20

* tlswg/dtls-conn-id (+1/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  1 pull requests submitted:
  - It is no longer true that an empty CID and no CID are the same (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls-conn-id/pull/78=20

* tlswg/tls-subcerts (+0/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC3)
  1 pull requests received 3 new comments:
